<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00088">
	<title id="e00640">Adjusting seat height</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00641">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00642">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025005_2.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00643"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To adjust the height of the seat, push the lever upwards or downwards.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>To lower the seat height, push down the lever several times.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To raise the seat height, pull up the lever several times.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>